libbluray (https://www.videolan.org/developers/libbluray.html), LGPL-2.1-or-later
  Copyright (C) 2009-2010  John Stebbins
  Copyright (C) 2010-2017  Petri Hintukainen <phintuka@users.sourceforge.net>
  Derived files:
    hdmv/registers.ts     from src/libbluray/register.c
    hdmv/uo-mask.ts       from src/libbluray/bdnav/uo_mask.c, uo_mask.h, uo_mask_table.h
    hdmv/vm.ts            from src/libbluray/hdmv/hdmv_vm.c
    nav/timeline.ts      derived from libbluray navigation time math
    nav/packets.ts       derived from libbluray navigation.c (_fill_clip, _fill_mark), clpi_parse.c (clpi_lookup_spn) and bluray.c (_find_next_playmark)
