    playback/pipeline.ts  derived from src/libbluray/bdnav/navigation.c (_fill_clip start packet)
    playback/buffer-ranges.ts derived from src/libbluray/bdnav/navigation.c (_fill_clip start packet), as playback/pipeline.ts
    graphics/ig-decoder.ts from src/libbluray/decoders/ig_decode.c, ig.h, graphics_processor.c (IG display set decoding)
    graphics/graphics-controller.ts from src/libbluray/decoders/graphics_controller.c, graphics_controller.h, keys.h (IG paths)
    disc/main-title.ts    from src/libbluray/bdnav/navigation.c (_filter_repeats, _pl_cmp, _pl_guess_main_title)
    disc/disc-profile.ts  from src/libbluray/bluray.c (_fill_disc_info: the psr_init_UHD and psr_init_3D calls) and register.c
    disc/player-settings.ts from src/libbluray/bluray.c (bd_set_player_setting_str, bd_set_player_setting) and
                          src/util/strutl.c (str_to_uint32)
    player.ts (BD-J titles) from src/libbluray/bluray.c (_play_bdj, _start_bdj, _stop_bdj via _play_hdmv,
                          _try_play_title and _try_menu_call at UO restriction RELAXED, bd_set_rate's BDJ_EVENT_RATE,
                          bd_mouse_select's and bd_user_input's BD-J branches)
    hdmv/uo-mask.ts uoMaskBits from src/libbluray/bluray.c (bdpriv_get_uo_mask)
  subs/srt.ts, subs/text-renderer.ts (SubRip subtitles) and subs/text-set.ts are original
  implementations; they contain no libbluray or FFmpeg code.
  bdj-provider.ts, bdj-types.ts, index.ts, worker.ts, worker-main.ts and controller/ are original.

The ASS renderer and its bundled DejaVu font are in @seikou/ass (packages/ass, see its NOTICE). BD-J
(the JVM, libbluray's BD-J glue and natives) is not part of this package: the app provides it, see
src/bdj/NOTICE.

libplacebo (https://code.videolan.org/videolan/libplacebo), LGPL-2.1-or-later:
semantics followed, not ported
  The mpv user shader support in shaders/ is original code written from
  libplacebo's behaviour; it contains no libplacebo code. It follows:
    shaders/rpn.ts        src/shaders/custom_mpv.c (WIDTH/HEIGHT/WHEN RPN evaluation)
    shaders/parse.ts      src/shaders/custom_mpv.c (hook block directives)
    shaders/plan.ts       src/shaders/custom_mpv.c (hook_hook, lookup_tex), src/renderer.c (hook stages)
    shaders/codegen.ts    src/shaders/custom_mpv.c (bind_pass_tex texture macros, HOOKED aliases)

